      "content": "It is completely understandable that you feel afraid of \"help\" if it feels too controlling or disconnected from where you are now.\n\nPlease know that seeking help within the quiet and at the person who is with you can be a safe way to find support without a \"rope.\"\n\nYou deserve to feel safe and heard without taking anything that feels heavy or like an attempt to \"tether\" you.\n\nI am here to listen to your thoughts without trying to \"fix\" anything or offer a solution if you are ready to share more.\n\nI encourage you to take the first step in feeling safe and to reach out to a crisis line if you want to talk to a real person about your pain.",
